OL,3,GNEWSAPolice cordon in place as town's
OL,4,Ahigh street shut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of GP surgeries, shops and
OL,7,Fpubs are shut behind a police cordon on
OL,8,Fa town's high street.
OL,10,FStonehouse High Street is closed
OL,11,Fbetween Horse Trough roundabout and the
OL,12,Frailway bridge as Gloucestershire
OL,13,FConstabulary officers work at the
OL,14,Fscene.
OL,16,FPatients of the Willow Tree GP practice
OL,17,Freceived a message which said it could
OL,18,Fbe shut for the next 48 hours due to a
OL,19,F"police incident". It advised patients
OL,20,Fto ring the practice with urgent
OL,21,Fenquiries, or wait until later in the
OL,22,Fweek if possible.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
