OL,3,GNEWSAPolice cordon in place as town's
OL,4,Ahigh street shut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Globe Inn pub said it was
OL,7,F"completely blocked in for the day" but
OL,8,Fadded it was offering hot drinks to
OL,9,Femergency workers and police officers
OL,10,Fat the scene.
